    "description": "### Impact\r\nExternal upload records restored from a crafted backup can make Discourse copy or delete files outside the temporary upload folder in the S3 bucket, including files of other sites sharing that bucket. Only sites using direct S3 uploads with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\r\n",
